  "description": "Packed full of high end features like an 80mm travel Suntour Duro DJ suspension fork, a Pivotal seat and post and front and back Alienation rims, the Steel Reserve 1.2 represents a remarkable value that rolls in a class all by itself. And because the Steel Reserve 1.2 wears a Haro badge, it comes with innovative, compact geometry that invented the entire freestyle segment more than 30 years ago.\nFull 4130 chromoly frame with integrated head tube, Euro BB shell, and horizontal dropouts\nSR Suntour Duro DJ-D 80mm travel fork with adjustable preload and rebound\nAvailable in Short (21.8\" TT) and Long (22.3\" TT)\nThree-piece chromoly 175mm 8-spline cranks with 25t sprocket\nAlienation PBR front and Black Sheep rear rims\nTektro IO mechanical disc brake with 6\" rotor\nPivotal seat and post\nKenda K-Rad 2.3\" tires",
